      "series": "Jujutsu Kaisen",
      "wiki": "jujutsu-kaisen.fandom.com",
      "page": "Cursed Technique",
      "section": "Technique Activation; Innate Techniques; Inherited Techniques",
      "text": "Fuel and formula differ. Mastery can omit gestures, while deliberately restoring them increases output. Multiple innate methods have a bodily storage constraint, and an external aid can change that constraint. Inherited methods come with training knowledge but can also expose weaknesses to rivals.",
      "proposal": "Give execution ceremony, source custody, bodily capacity and knowledge circulation distinct owners.",
