      "series": "Elden Ring",
      "wiki": "eldenring.fandom.com",
      "page": "Law of Causality",
      "section": "Description; Effect; Notes",
      "text": "An incantation sets up automatic retaliation after qualifying damaging hits. Perfect blocking can prevent its trigger. Its title does not establish unlimited control over causal history.",
      "proposal": "Define a reaction by the event it counts, not by the breadth of its lore name.",
